    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/59990f180094891b41787bde8eb592e0.poster.avif?t=1751991040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/59990f180094891b41787bde8eb592e0.webm?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/59990f180094891b41787bde8eb592e0.mp4?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Buster is an action roguelike game with deckbuilding features, set in a vibrant post-apocalyptic world. You'll wield powerful cards, discover game-changing combos, and fight your way through Psychic\u2019s maze to liberate Dusty Creek in real-time, action-packed battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Powerful Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your creativity is your strongest weapon. Combine cards in unexpected ways to unleash devastating effects. Turn a simple Flamethrower into a swirling inferno of destruction by pairing it with the Hurricane card. Every weapon has multiple combos waiting to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/22aabb9c32fa1a10016549efd1dbe33a.poster.avif?t=1751991040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/22aabb9c32fa1a10016549efd1dbe33a.webm?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/22aabb9c32fa1a10016549efd1dbe33a.mp4?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A World of Teenage Rebellion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Buster, you'll lead a group of plucky teenagers in their quest to overthrow the evil mage Psychic. Craft magical cards from the mysterious Card Dust and build a resistance force to reclaim Dusty Creek!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/fa624cfa5a667307e6f02a8b246df381.avif?t=1751991040\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time action meets deckbuilding:</strong>\u00a0Battle enemies while crafting your perfect deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many cards, infinite strategies:</strong>\u00a0Unlock, loot, and craft new cards, experiment with countless combos, and upgrade your deck with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike progression:</strong> Die, learn, and return stronger. Upgrade your cards and character between runs to face greater challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique world &amp; characters:</strong> A post-apocalyptic world filled with humor, danger, and a sense of adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized hand-drawn visuals:</strong> Distinct art style that brings the quirky world of Card Buster to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-launch content:</strong> New cards, new combos, and even more ways to play after release with free updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Card Buster and experience a unique blend of action, strategy, and roguelike progression. With its engaging combat, deckbuilding mechanics, and charming world, Card Buster offers a fresh take on multiple genres. Will you be the one to master the cards and save Dusty Creek? The fate of the town is in your hands!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/59990f180094891b41787bde8eb592e0.poster.avif?t=1751991040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/59990f180094891b41787bde8eb592e0.webm?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/59990f180094891b41787bde8eb592e0.mp4?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Buster is an action roguelike game with deckbuilding features, set in a vibrant post-apocalyptic world. You'll wield powerful cards, discover game-changing combos, and fight your way through Psychic\u2019s maze to liberate Dusty Creek in real-time, action-packed battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Powerful Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your creativity is your strongest weapon. Combine cards in unexpected ways to unleash devastating effects. Turn a simple Flamethrower into a swirling inferno of destruction by pairing it with the Hurricane card. Every weapon has multiple combos waiting to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/22aabb9c32fa1a10016549efd1dbe33a.poster.avif?t=1751991040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/22aabb9c32fa1a10016549efd1dbe33a.webm?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/22aabb9c32fa1a10016549efd1dbe33a.mp4?t=1751991040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A World of Teenage Rebellion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Buster, you'll lead a group of plucky teenagers in their quest to overthrow the evil mage Psychic. Craft magical cards from the mysterious Card Dust and build a resistance force to reclaim Dusty Creek!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915400/extras/fa624cfa5a667307e6f02a8b246df381.avif?t=1751991040\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time action meets deckbuilding:</strong>\u00a0Battle enemies while crafting your perfect deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many cards, infinite strategies:</strong>\u00a0Unlock, loot, and craft new cards, experiment with countless combos, and upgrade your deck with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike progression:</strong> Die, learn, and return stronger. Upgrade your cards and character between runs to face greater challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique world &amp; characters:</strong> A post-apocalyptic world filled with humor, danger, and a sense of adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized hand-drawn visuals:</strong> Distinct art style that brings the quirky world of Card Buster to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-launch content:</strong> New cards, new combos, and even more ways to play after release with free updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Card Buster and experience a unique blend of action, strategy, and roguelike progression. With its engaging combat, deckbuilding mechanics, and charming world, Card Buster offers a fresh take on multiple genres. Will you be the one to master the cards and save Dusty Creek? The fate of the town is in your hands!</p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to bust through enemies with powerful card combos in this action-packed roguelike! Build your deck, master crazy synergies, and take on the evil mage Psychic to free Dusty Creek in this fast-paced, post-apocalyptic adventure!",
